\u00e4ltetechnik) spielerisch entdecken und erste berufstypische Aufgaben ausprobieren. Ob Technik, Gesundheit oder Handwerk \u2013 finde heraus, was dir am meisten Spa\u00df macht! :)\n\nEarly Access: Sei unter den Ersten, die jobVRiety testen!"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "CoverImageSafeAreaTemplateLandscape_2560x1440.png", "id": "3902217326706597", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393450_3902217330039930_1240378813803928232_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Xu9g_5vFEFkQ7kNvwG1-xXY&_nc_oc=Adotmc9OmsfpzkW0g_4og1bZ9Mh1bjR5-T_ZYfQv9M1-abAlxI04hJGTP74pvHD1ynA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQqlkeK7j3U2nlZt4BSFjwWvCTTYaPMzlHc_sOV93WnNQ&oe=6AFC88F6"}, {"file_name": "CoverImageSafeAreaTemplateLandscape_1080x360.png", "id": "3076099412552471", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825091_3076099415885804_5417180118801740963_n.png?_nc_cat=109&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=407zhyZAty0Q7kNvwGknzGX&_nc_oc=Adot31rF6rTU33AID3u322lvaIl_UZjKL51HCvcoiaDbz1jhQEyygyjD9jFm8s2fYco&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQUekSDThS1TTE3dNBtkvqZho0D63vSeOO6mgUJEU109A&oe=6AFC84F6"}, {"file_name": "CoverImageSafeAreaTemplateSquare_1440x1440.png", "id": "2448391595528830", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491824609_2448391598862163_943533169723644988_n.png?_nc_cat=107&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=epMHMnBuV-EQ7kNvwGHQMEe&_nc_oc=Adq_zyTnx9_fCtD8yPU396sFvLTXybd8P8SJ-q8ARS7-NM-REYB74zcBMS99fKRD5rY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQReIyGOy21tgEHlaCCU6ILtskwLYwjx0kJmMGXQ3PosvQ&oe=6AFC897E"}, {"file_name": "JobVR_LogoClaim_rgb.png", "id": "1748084809102207", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "u